.TH QKOTLINC 1 "September 2026" "Qore JNI"
.SH NAME
qkotlinc \- compile Kotlin sources against Qore APIs
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B qkotlinc
[options] source.kt ...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes the Kotlin compiler with the Qore JNI bridge on its class path. The private packaged compiler is used if no kotlinc is found in PATH.
.SH OPTIONS
Use -d DIRECTORY for output, -cp PATH for additional dependencies, and -q for quiet output.
.PP
Run the command with --help for the full option list.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR qore (1)
